1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,777
We climbed a mountain called Mount Echo.

2
00:00:02,727 --> 00:00:06,318
From its peak, a long range stretched into the distance.

3
00:00:06,318 --> 00:00:09,818
A ridge above the slope allowed us to overlook the valley.

4
00:00:09,818 --> 00:00:13,011
On the eastern hillside grew oriental lilies.

5
00:00:13,011 --> 00:00:18,181
A village lay to the southeast, a farm to the southwest, and a forest to the northeast.

6
00:00:18,181 --> 00:00:20,852
The northwest was hidden by clouds.

7
00:00:20,852 --> 00:00:24,249
In the southern part of the valley, a stream looked brown.

8
00:00:24,249 --> 00:00:27,215
Do not overlook that colour,’ Mira said.

9
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:30,159
Our trip suddenly had a question to answer.

